    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into an animal kingdom where wits and strategy collide. The king\u2019s financial advisor is about to retire, and the great animal houses are mobilizing \u2014 through auctions and investments, they\u2019ll battle for the throne of wealth. Only one can rise to power and become the kingdom\u2019s next financial mastermind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a strategy game that combines resource management and auction mechanics. You\u2019ll take on the role of uniquely styled animal characters, collecting valuable items from the forest and bidding for them at the grand royal auction. With clever combinations, sharp judgment, and flexible financial tactics, you must outwit your opponents in high-stakes auctions to earn the most wealth and claim your place as the kingdom\u2019s financial advisor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd8a <strong>Strategic Auction Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Time your bids, read your rivals, and craft your auction strategy to gain the upper hand in turn-based bidding battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc51 <strong>Single &amp; Multiplayer Modes</strong> \u2013 Whether facing off against cunning AI or challenging your friends, the game delivers tense, strategic showdowns every round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter this vibrant yet power-hungry animal world and prove your financial savvy to claim the glory that\u2019s rightfully yours!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into an animal kingdom where wits and strategy collide. The king\u2019s financial advisor is about to retire, and the great animal houses are mobilizing \u2014 through auctions and investments, they\u2019ll battle for the throne of wealth. Only one can rise to power and become the kingdom\u2019s next financial mastermind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a strategy game that combines resource management and auction mechanics. You\u2019ll take on the role of uniquely styled animal characters, collecting valuable items from the forest and bidding for them at the grand royal auction. With clever combinations, sharp judgment, and flexible financial tactics, you must outwit your opponents in high-stakes auctions to earn the most wealth and claim your place as the kingdom\u2019s financial advisor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd8a <strong>Strategic Auction Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Time your bids, read your rivals, and craft your auction strategy to gain the upper hand in turn-based bidding battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc51 <strong>Single &amp; Multiplayer Modes</strong> \u2013 Whether facing off against cunning AI or challenging your friends, the game delivers tense, strategic showdowns every round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter this vibrant yet power-hungry animal world and prove your financial savvy to claim the glory that\u2019s rightfully yours!</p>",
